he hormone injections is  to basically it's like steroids for your  eggs as a natural woman you drop one egg  a month but because of these hormones  you have tons of them and then you want  them to get big and fat and juicy so  that they can see them when they're  going in to harvest the egg  then it's the last 30 hours when they  say okay now you're ready to go that's  when you get the trigger shot and that  was pretty intense  so pull down the pants look in the  mirror and they teach you you have to  inject yourself so hard that it goes  behind the muscle and they tell you as  you check it if there's blood that it's  not far enough so you have to push it  out and do it again so thank God I got  it on the first try so the trigger shot  then will start the process of getting  the follicles ready and the eggs ready  for retrieval 30 hours later show up at  the doctor's office and they put me to  sleep they go up inside me and they you  know broke the follicles to suction out  the eggs and the eggs are immediately  frozen the process itself is very quick  the procedure took maybe 20 minutes the  doctor predicted that I would have 12 to  14 eggs at the end of this process that  they could harvest out of those eggs  they say one out of every four count on  those being viable I ended up having 20  eggs which was a lot more than they  expected and about 48 hours after the  surgery I immediately just puffed out  with the 20 follicles that my body had  created as the doctor goes in there to  retrieve the eggs they basically  puncture each follicle and then suck out  this little microscopic egg well all  that fluid around that egg now has to go  somewhere it was the most frustrating  time ever being a woman that it has  curves and has always thought it been  conscious of what am i eating and my  exercising and am i losing weight am i  gaining weight I was put in a position  where my body was constantly gaining  weight even though I wasn't eating I  wasn't drinking I couldn't even have  water and yet I'm gaining weight  it sucked it was absolutely terrible for  some people freezing your eggs might be  easy lickety-split no problem I'm back  to work the next day for me personally  it was not that everybody's unique their  situations are unique but I think it's  important to know all sides so you can  make an educated decision they  on all perspectives when I grew up I  never felt I could be respected for  wanting to be the person that I truly am  so whatever you choose let it be your  choice what's right for you not what the  expectations were review growing up or  what your parents want you to do what  your boyfriend wants you to do your  husband its you have to have the best  relationship with yourself
 

